{"questions":[{"question":"Faktoriser $4x^2 - 8x$.","options":["$4x(x - 2)$","$4(x^2 - 8x)$","$x(4x - 8)$","$4x(x - 8)$"],"explanation":"Felles faktor $4x$: $4x^2 - 8x = 4x(x - 2)$."},{"question":"Faktoriser $x^2 - 16$.","options":["$(x + 4)(x - 4)$","$(x - 4)^2$","$(x + 4)^2$","$(x - 16)(x + 1)$"],"explanation":"Konjugatsetninga: $x^2 - 16 = (x + 4)(x - 4)$."},{"question":"Faktoriser $x^2 + 5x + 6$.","options":["$(x + 2)(x + 3)$","$(x + 1)(x + 6)$","$(x + 5)(x + 6)$","$(x - 2)(x - 3)$"],"explanation":"Tal som gangar gjev 6 og summerer til 5: 2 og 3. $(x + 2)(x + 3)$."},{"question":"Forenkle $\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3}$.","options":["$x - 3$","$x + 3$","$x - 9$","$x^2 - 3$"],"explanation":"$\\frac{(x+3)(x-3)}{x+3} = x - 3$."},{"question":"Faktoriser $x^2 - 10x + 25$.","options":["$(x - 5)^2$","$(x + 5)^2$","$(x - 5)(x + 5)$","$(x - 25)(x - 1)$"],"explanation":"Andre kvadratsetning: $x^2 - 10x + 25 = (x - 5)^2$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"86d9af0034350a28","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:01:12.964Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":30,"tm":{"44fc4f68f5c23a02":"Faktoriser $4x^2 - 8x$.","f4b646f9269b6bdf":"$4x(x - 2)$","d0a91767c055e91e":"$4(x^2 - 8x)$","ddfb088a71a6d4a2":"$x(4x - 8)$","a1bcc20498a3a43b":"$4x(x - 8)$","eae9130311e13174":"Felles faktor $4x$: $4x^2 - 8x = 4x(x - 2)$.","298448b752b05578":"Faktoriser $x^2 - 16$.","ad45c40218199f99":"$(x + 4)(x - 4)$","9f4269c978a5bde6":"$(x - 4)^2$","026c04485fc136c8":"$(x + 4)^2$","4244f7c69d749df9":"$(x - 16)(x + 1)$","d8778efef983756a":"Konjugatsetninga: $x^2 - 16 = (x + 4)(x - 4)$.","06aa5475bafac9f5":"Faktoriser $x^2 + 5x + 6$.","812e442289031ed2":"$(x + 2)(x + 3)$","9f0211fd9aab8106":"$(x + 1)(x + 6)$","4b1e0b019f1d6424":"$(x + 5)(x + 6)$","f40827c51203679f":"$(x - 2)(x - 3)$","cb29282e83a27fb1":"Tal som gangar gjev 6 og summerer til 5: 2 og 3. $(x + 2)(x + 3)$.","4a3befa12ba80317":"Forenkle $\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3}$.","ed8ee075f954d532":"$x - 3$","c3d62e3337ca6623":"$x + 3$","3bcb10371184c458":"$x - 9$","4df6d22b102150